    {
      "question": "Factorise completely: 9p² - 25",
      "options": ["(9p - 25)(p + 1)", "(3p - 5)(3p + 5)", "9(p² - 25)", "(9p - 5)(p + 5)"],
      "correct": 1,
      "points": 15,
      "explanation": "Difference of squares: 9p² = (3p)², 25 = 5² → (3p)² - 5² = (3p - 5)(3p + 5)."
